    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_1",
      "hash64": "60396BBCAB779DC0",
      "text": "橘子学院的玄关。\\n能从前台接取要上的课程。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_18",
      "hash64": "F93009975C416C68",
      "text": "葡萄学院的玄关。\\n能从前台接取要上的课程。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_2",
      "hash64": "60396EBCAB77A2D9",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]的房间。\\n位于学校里，另一个属于自己的房间。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_3",
      "hash64": "60396DBCAB77A126",
      "text": "妮莫的房间。\\n整理得井井有条。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_4",
      "hash64": "603970BCAB77A63F",
      "text": "派帕的房间。\\n飘着感觉很好吃的气味。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_5",
      "hash64": "60396FBCAB77A48C",
      "text": "牡丹的房间。\\n放满了机械，有点昏暗。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_6",
      "hash64": "603972BCAB77A9A5",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]与妮莫的教室。\\n教授综合课程，班主任是吉尼亚老师。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_7",
      "hash64": "603971BCAB77A7F2",
      "text": "高一年级的２年级生教室。\\n教授文科课程，班主任是赛吉老师。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_19",
      "hash64": "F9300A975C416E1B",
      "text": "派帕的教室。\\n教授文科课程，班主任是赛吉老师。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_8",
      "hash64": "603974BCAB77AD0B",
      "text": "别的班级的教室。\\n教授理科课程，班主任是泰姆老师。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_20",
      "hash64": "F93A13975C49D1EB",
      "text": "牡丹的教室。\\n教授理科课程，班主任是泰姆老师。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_9",
      "hash64": "603973BCAB77AB58",
      "text": "校长的房间。\\n摆放着克拉韦尔校长的桌子和研究器材。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_10",
      "hash64": "F93001975C415ED0",
      "text": "老师们的房间。\\n在这里能遇到不同的老师。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_11",
      "hash64": "F93002975C416083",
      "text": "状态不佳的学生会来这里休息。\\n也有不少学生是为了米莫莎老师而来的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_12",
      "hash64": "F93003975C416236",
      "text": "从日用品到道具一应俱全。\\n这里的面包总是刚出炉的，十分神奇。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_13",
      "hash64": "F93004975C4163E9",
      "text": "用于家政课程的教室。\\n陈列着干净闪亮的餐具和厨具。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_14",
      "hash64": "F93005975C41659C",
      "text": "用于生物课程的教室。\\n有许多显微镜之类的实验道具。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_15",
      "hash64": "F93006975C41674F",
      "text": "用于美术课程的教室。\\n展示着学生们的作品。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_16",
      "hash64": "F93007975C416902",
      "text": "食堂阿姨亲手制作的料理\\n每天都好吃又充满营养。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "schoolmap_2_17",
      "hash64": "F93008975C416AB5",
      "text": "用于对战学课程的校庭。\\n既能在这运动，又能在这休息的放松场所。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
