    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "schoolmap_5_0",
      "hash64": "565E55BCA58C311E",
      "text": "蓝莓学园的玄关。\\n中央设有对战场。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "schoolmap_5_1",
      "hash64": "565E56BCA58C32D1",
      "text": "能在４个区域边冒险\\n边学习宝可梦知识的海中庭园。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "schoolmap_5_2",
      "hash64": "565E53BCA58C2DB8",
      "text": "乌栗的教室。\\n会用于校内的活动。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "schoolmap_5_3",
      "hash64": "565E54BCA58C2F6B",
      "text": "丹瑜的教室。\\n班主任是白蕾雅老师。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "schoolmap_5_4",
      "hash64": "565E59BCA58C37EA",
      "text": "从日用品到道具一应俱全。\\n需注意的是，这里只接受ＢＰ支付。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "schoolmap_5_5",
      "hash64": "565E5ABCA58C399D",
      "text": "食堂阿姨亲手做的料理\\n分量十足，管饱。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "schoolmap_5_6",
      "hash64": "565E57BCA58C3484",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]的房间。\\n位于学园里，另一个属于自己的房间。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
